OL,3,GNEWSABrothers set for epic Nepal climb
OL,4,Afor veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo brothers who are former British
OL,7,FArmy soldiers are about to embark on a
OL,8,Fclimbing challenge in the Himalayas to
OL,9,Fraise funds for veterans.
OL,11,FJosh and Jake Bruton, from Hastings,
OL,12,FEast Sussex, told BBC Radio Sussex they
OL,13,Fare setting off on Friday to climb
OL,14,FLobuche East and Island Peak in Nepal.
OL,16,FThe double peaks are both more than
OL,17,F6,000m (19,685ft) high.
OL,19,FThey said: "We believe in pushing
OL,20,Fourselves physically to support a cause
OL,21,Fthat means so much to us."
